{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e06-scene-22",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "将功折罪的机会  (Kaiwen's Chance to Redeem Himself)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "stella": "斯戴拉"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Once Xin Huimei signs with Xingtian, the two blacklisted commentators hurriedly reach out behind their patron's back. Kaiwen tells Stella to take a break while he goes to settle scores in person. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "好，知道了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大，他们两个越过那边来接触咱们了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "这回怎么说？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "姐姐，你歇着。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我将功折罪的机会来了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我是星天总编室的霍凯文，坐吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "二位那天在文娱论上故意吵架、默契炒作的时候。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我是文娱论的执行监制，那天我可真是倒霉。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "二位真是说得比唱得好听。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "演技比演员还纯熟，就是有些时候略显浮夸。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "好，知道了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Alright, got it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大，他们两个越过那边来接触咱们了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Boss, the two of them went behind the other side's back to reach out to us.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "这回怎么说？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What do we do this time?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "姐姐，你歇着。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sister Stella, you take a rest.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我将功折罪的机会来了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'My chance to make amends for my earlier slip has arrived.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我是星天总编室的霍凯文，坐吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am Huo Kaiwen from Xingtian's chief editor's office—have a seat.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "二位那天在文娱论上故意吵架、默契炒作的时候。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That day when the two of you staged a quarrel and hyped yourselves up on Entertainment Talk—'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我是文娱论的执行监制，那天我可真是倒霉。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I was the executive producer of Entertainment Talk, and I really had rotten luck that day.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "二位真是说得比唱得好听。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The two of you truly talk sweeter than a song.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "演技比演员还纯熟，就是有些时候略显浮夸。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Your acting is smoother than real actors, though at times a touch overdone.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "好，知道了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "老大，他们两个越过那边来接触咱们了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "这回怎么说？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "姐姐，你歇着。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我将功折罪的机会来了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我是星天总编室的霍凯文，坐吧。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "二位那天在文娱论上故意吵架、默契炒作的时候。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我是文娱论的执行监制，那天我可真是倒霉。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "二位真是说得比唱得好听。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "演技比演员还纯熟，就是有些时候略显浮夸。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "With polite sarcasm, Kaiwen lets the two commentators know he saw right through their staged feud from the start. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
